# In a 20x6 terminal the Overdue view still works, and Quick Add to the inbox adds the task there.
size 20 6
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys gO
see Overdue
keys j }
keys qi
see Quick Add
type Buy milk
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Renew passport @due({today-2})
	- Buy milk
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
